{"id":"loca","lemma":"loca","pos":"noun","rank":530,"glosses":["a madwoman, female equivalent of loco","slut (usually said of a woman...)","an effeminate man or boy"],"ipa":"/ˈloka/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"locas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-loca.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mi esposa está loca.","en":"My wife is mad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/103651"},{"text":"Las chicas están locas.","en":"Girls are crazy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/637134"},{"text":"Creo que estás loca.","en":"I think you're mad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/550105"},{"text":"¿Os habéis vuelto locas?","en":"Have you lost your mind?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459836"},{"text":"Estoy un poco loca.","en":"I'm a little crazy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1191450"}]}